+# P23 tool and format versions (interop record)
+
+Checked against each tool's own documentation at the version named, never against the reference.
+Every slice adds its own section; the lead merges them.
+
+## Docker (K1: P23-08..12)
+
+| Tool / format | Version pinned | Where | Notes |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| Debian base image | `debian:trixie-slim` + index digest | `docker/pins.json` → `base` | digest filled by `scripts/docker/pins.py refresh` |
+| s6-overlay | 3.2.1.0 (ISC) | `docker/pins.json` → `bundles.s6-overlay` | v3 layout: `/etc/s6-overlay/s6-rc.d/<svc>/{type,run,finish,up,dependencies.d}`, `user/contents.d`, `/init`; env `S6_KEEP_ENV`, `S6_BEHAVIOUR_IF_STAGE2_FAILS`, `S6_CMD_WAIT_FOR_SERVICES_MAXTIME`, `S6_LOGGING`, `S6_CMD_USE_TERMINAL` |
+| Node.js (web build only) | 24.21.0 (MIT) | `docker/pins.json` → `bundles.node` | matches `.nvmrc`; pnpm from `package.json` `packageManager` through corepack |
+| uv | the installer's pin | `scripts/install/pins.json` (P23-02) | targets read: `linux-x64-glibc` / `linux-arm64-glibc` (also `*-gnu`, Rust triples) |
+| Python in the image | 3.14 (uv-managed) | `docker/Dockerfile` `ARG PYTHON_VERSION` | uv checks its own managed download |
+| hadolint | 2.12.0 (GPL-3.0, CI tool only, never shipped) | `docker/pins.json` → `bundles.hadolint` | rule ids DL3008 (ignored with reason), SC2086 (inline ignore with reason) |
+| actionlint | 1.7.7 (MIT, CI tool only) | `docker/pins.json` → `bundles.actionlint` | |
+| Docker Compose file format | Compose Specification (`docker compose` v2) | `docker/compose*.yaml` | `name:`, `x-` extension + YAML merge key, nested `${A:-${B}}` defaults |
+| GitHub Actions | `actions/checkout` v4.2.2, `actions/upload-artifact` v4.6.2, `actions/download-artifact` v4.3.0 | `.github/workflows/docker.yml` | pinned by SHA written without network: verify before the first run |
+| skopeo / buildx imagetools | runner images' versions | `.github/workflows/docker.yml` | `skopeo copy --digestfile`, `docker buildx imagetools create/inspect` |
+| OCI image annotations | `org.opencontainers.image.*` | both Dockerfiles | title, description, licenses, source, vendor, revision |
